Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  兄弟  -凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, brother. - Kelvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你还记得  -你在这儿做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you remember? - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你的目的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same reason as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们互帮互助一下如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say we help each other out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你帮我们找到凯莉·克莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You help us track down Kelly Kline,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂就欢迎你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will be welcomed back into the fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有权那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have the power to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我只是传个信儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. I can't. I'm just the messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但约书亚有权\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Joshua can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只求你听听我们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we ask is that you hear us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  小卡  我给你打过三通电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Cass. I've called you three times now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said you were a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个恶魔  你是罗斯玛丽  怀着孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a demon, you're Rosemary, complete with baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉  天使  温家兄弟  那些好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, the angels? The Winchesters? The good guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都想要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我可以保护你  我可以保护你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can protect you. I can protect your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我尝试联系你好几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to get ahold of you for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.65,0:00:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点  跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay cool. Walk with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们想帮忙  -你管这叫帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We wanna help. - You call this helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.87,0:01:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有小卡的消息了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you hear anything from Cass yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  还失踪着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Still MIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你觉得他还好吧  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think he's all right? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来  米克让萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, Mick let Sam and Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.09,0:01:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿走了柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}get their hands on the bloody Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该服用维他命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vitamin time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.49,0:01:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:01:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.16,0:02:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧  小凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Kel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.17,0:02:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不吃药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not taking your pills,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挑食\N{\fnArial\fs30}picking at your food...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}refusing to bathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再这样不尊重你体内的神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop disrespecting the God inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会害死我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.61,0:02:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他不会停手于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's not gonna stop there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.17,0:02:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每一个可悲软弱的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every sad, weak human,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每一个刻板的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}every tight-ass angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每一个可怜巴巴的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}every sniveling demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都会被吞噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll all be consumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.81,0:02:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩你的游戏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不管你是健康还是病怏怏  肮脏还是干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whether you're healthy or sick, filthy or clean,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他都会降生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那将多愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算帮我们俩个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do us both a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洗个澡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们不能在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we won't ever be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们两个都不会有幸福结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no happy ending for either of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她的话是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if what she said is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真的是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this is what you really are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真会对世界做出那样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you'll do to the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么多痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么多死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that death,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能允许那种事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第12季第19集]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干什么呢  美丽心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, Beautiful Mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们追踪不到大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I just figured we can't exactly track Dagon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.99,0:06:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就去补习了一下拿非利人的知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I've been reading up on nephilim,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想看看还有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to figure out how much time we have before --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-小路西法出生  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 'Lil Lucifer pops? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们知道凯莉是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so we know Kelly got pregnant
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,12月初怀的孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometime in early December.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.39,0:06:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据传说  拿非利人不需要九月怀胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the lore, nephilim don't need 9 months
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就满妊娠期\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get to full term,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得她大概会在\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I think she will be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5月8日左右产子\N{\fnArial\fs30}giving birth around May 18th.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那么  -我们还有不到一个月来找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which means... - We have less than a month to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  而且毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and exactly no idea where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  就算我们找到了她  又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but even if we do find her, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.99,0:06:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我替萨姆重说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me rephrase that for Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.78,0:06:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你小子跑哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不接我们的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why have you ignored our phone calls?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去的地方  信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I was, the -- the reception
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}was, uh...poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没信号吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bars?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没信号  这就是他的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bars. That's his excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去了天堂  我去跟天使合作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in Heaven. I was working with the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我看到大衮抓走了凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I saw Dagon had captured Kelly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他们能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I thought they could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很高兴你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're glad you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你在天堂毫无进展的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, 'cause while you were striking out in Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是有机会杀死大衮  但输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had a shot at Dagon, and we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.41,0:07:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我收到你的留言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...received your messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  你收到留言啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you did -- you did receive the messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好啊  那很好  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, that's good. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你不仅丢下了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So not only were you ditching us,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.79,0:07:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还无视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you were also ignoring us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.92,0:07:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们当时真需要后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we really could've used the backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你忙着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, you were too busy with, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-没结果  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing? - Dean, I --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, whatever. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, y--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就想还这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to return this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(迪恩最爱13首)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:08:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要留着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep those.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在事情这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}With everything that's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这么突然消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't just go dark like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不知道你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很担心  这样不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were worried. That's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是有意增添你的烦恼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't mean to add to your distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我总是失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I just keep failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一次又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你被抓走时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were taken,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找了几个月都找不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I searched for months and I couldn't find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后凯莉从我眼皮下逃跑  我又找不到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Kelly escaped on my watch, and I couldn't find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.11,0:09:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要带着胜利回来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to come back here with a win for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是为我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}For myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为只有你运气不佳吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're the only one rolling snake eyes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她本来在我和萨姆手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam, we had her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但后来又把她弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had Kelly and we lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们再找到她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you find her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆在查呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  他一心想找到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, he's hell-bent on finding something
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.19,0:10:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不需要杀她和那孩子的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doesn't mean killing her or her kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  如果他找不到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. And if he doesn't find something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.53,0:10:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you run out of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.27,0:10:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}could either of you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能杀一个无辜者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill an innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到更好的办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.45,0:10:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  傻蛋  我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, dumbass. We.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  我  和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, me, and Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在一起时更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're just better together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.31,0:10:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你回来了  自由意志队加油吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now that you're back, let's go, Team Free Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去做个了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.97,0:10:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.89,0:10:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想喝杯啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd like a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不许我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't let me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了  哥们  睡会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Get some sleep, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚找不到大衮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna find Dagon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  如果我们一直以来思路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what if we've been going about this whole thing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.01,0:11:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都错了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wrong way, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:12:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们追踪不到大衮  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, we -- we can't track Dagon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道  我们试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that. We've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我们能追踪那个拿非利人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But -- but what if we can track the nephilim?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那孩子是半天使  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, the baby's half-angel, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得嘉德利尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So remember Gadreel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个占用了你的身体的疯子天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The psycho angel who took your body for a test drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-记得  他咋了  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, what about him? - All right, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was this, uh, there was this spell --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.54,0:12:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡和我当时为找他研究过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass and I were working on it -- to -- to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.55,0:12:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -你需要嘉德利尔的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You needed Gadreel's grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而他抽不到足够的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he couldn't yank enough out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I am an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.91,0:12:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这我不反对  -别闹  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, there's no argument there. - No, stop. Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能量抽取\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grace extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,追踪咒没成功  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tracking spell was a bust, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但抽取仪式成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But -- but the extraction ritual worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那又怎样  -如果小卡对凯莉的孩子用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So what if Cass used it on Kelly's kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个拿非利人就是有天使能量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, a-a nephilim's just a human soul
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.35,0:12:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类灵魂  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}with angelic grace, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那如果除去能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you remove the grace --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-孩子就是个孩子了  -孩子就是个孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kid's just a kid. - Kid's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样  凯莉就不用死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, Kelly wouldn't have to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的孩子也不用死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and neither would her baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我去  -我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hot damn. - Hot damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我们还得先找到凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we still obviously have to find Kelly in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这也只是个理论  -不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, it's just a theory, but -- - No, no, no. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是办法  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去找小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.85,0:13:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为那会成功吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really thought that was gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有机会成为圣母玛利亚2.0\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the chance to be Mary of Nazareth, Part 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,邪恶基督版的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil Jesus Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.09,0:13:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他不是  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:14:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是  我的宝宝不是邪恶的  他救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not. My baby's not evil. He saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为是这么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you think happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是在自救\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他才不在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.47,0:14:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.09,0:14:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会生  你会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's born, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.44,0:14:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在的  陪在他身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there, right by his side,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抚育他  爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}to nurture him, love him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help him to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像个妈妈那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a mother should.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  兄弟  拿到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, brother. Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.41,0:15:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,子弹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,枪膛里只有两发\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were only two in the chamber,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又不能再多要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I couldn't exactly ask for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.55,0:15:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-一发给大衮  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One for Dagon... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一发给凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}One for Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他们很接近  -我们感应到的天堂震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're close. - The celestial pulse we felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约书亚追踪到了附近的一栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joshua tracked it to a house nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(迪恩来电)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(未接来电  迪恩)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做的是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing the right thing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,执行约书亚的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Committing to Joshua's plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把天使置于温家人之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting angelkind above the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在天堂的名誉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your reputation in Heaven is --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这跟我的名誉毫无关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has nothing to do with my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这么做是为了温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am doing this for the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我偷走柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I stole the Colt
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是为了不让他们搅进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep them out of this mission
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.19,0:15:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们不用对付大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to keep them safe from Dagon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了那姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill this girl
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样萨姆和迪恩就不用那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that Sam and Dean don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,荷宰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hozai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.35,0:16:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大衮  那姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagon, the girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都在房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好戏开场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.51,0:16:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有五秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we've got 5 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到更多超级金句提示  并赢得大奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see more of the Super Catch Phrase and win the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,辛迪  价值350美元  说出它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cindy, for $350, tell us what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,举重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumping iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇普和辛迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chip and Cindy --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,观众席上很多人认为他们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a lot of people in the audience who think they know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有接手机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have a Toss Up Catch Phrase for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的对手知道  但她不能答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now your opponent knows, but she can't guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有你能答  价值400美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you are entitled. There's $400 in the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-奇普  说答案  -铁幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chip, what is it? - The Iron Curtain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我太激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got so excited there myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I went to the opposite thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到那姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的语音信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请留你的语音邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your voice...A mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.87,0:18:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜  没人接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess -- no answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡是怎么把柯尔特枪从保险箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how did Cass even get the Colt out of the safe
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你把柯尔特枪放回保险箱了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you -- you put the Colt back in the safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.87,0:18:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-就放在我枕头下面  -你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was under my pillow. - It...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢把它放身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to keep it close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来我房间耍了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came into my room and he played me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他把我们都耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he played us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到他  然后揍扁他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I say we find him and we kick his feathered ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  小卡拿走柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Cass wouldn't have taken the Colt
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是想对付什么大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he wasn't going up against something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那我们找到他  搞清情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I say we find him, figure out what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后揍扁他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we kick his feathered ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你终于抓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you finally caught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚在地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back there in the basement...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是来杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you came to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有任务要执行  但我失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a mission and I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.83,0:19:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.56,0:19:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在尽量拉开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to put as much
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和大衮之间的距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}distance between you and Dagon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.87,0:19:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚安顿容器睡下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put the container down for a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.67,0:20:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吾王  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.29,0:20:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天使  找到了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels, they found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中一个抓走了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them took her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.73,0:20:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wait a minute. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.45,0:20:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让温家兄弟的宠物狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you let the Winchesters' purse dog
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.68,0:20:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓走了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}take my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.47,0:20:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.19,0:20:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会找到他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:21:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  否则你的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you will, or that little fantasy of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,统治天堂和人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}ruling Heaven and Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  我加宝宝三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}you, me, baby makes three...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是幻想  那是你对我的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a fantasy. That was your promise to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再给你个承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's another promise for you --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}find my boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我将给你的折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the torments I will visit upon you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会是无尽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be infinite.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去解决这事  大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make this right, Dagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解决它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(北点汽车旅馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.86,0:21:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.89,0:21:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在跟约书亚交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was communicating with Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个天使  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an angel. I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在接受指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was getting my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前杀不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't kill you back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在  我要带你回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, I will take you to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.94,0:22:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的生命将终结  你的宝宝也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life will end, and your baby's, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.87,0:22:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那会迅速  没有痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be swift and painless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.63,0:22:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.09,0:22:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不成功呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it doesn't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人类能踏过那扇门还活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No human form can step through that gate and survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.35,0:22:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的灵魂将升入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your souls will ascend to Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.88,0:22:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的每个细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and every cell of your beings
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.13,0:22:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都会回归宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}will return to the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.32,0:22:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry, Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是路西法的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son of Lucifer...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.49,0:22:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是人/大天使混血儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a human/archangel hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.61,0:22:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}That power...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.86,0:22:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's beyond comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.32,0:22:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your child
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:23:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能让宇宙臣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}could bring the universe to its knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也或许能抬升它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or lift it to its feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.18,0:23:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个孩子  人之初性本善\N{\fnArial\fs30}This baby, nothing is born evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.74,0:23:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take that chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.64,0:23:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.55,0:23:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自杀任务  没有应急方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suicide mission, no contingencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.85,0:23:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一堆废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.14,0:23:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道卡西迪奥在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know where Castiel is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.97,0:23:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's an angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.99,0:23:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.25,0:23:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得  如果你好好想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a feeling, ya dig deep enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.38,0:23:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能猜个八九不离十\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can make an excellent guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.55,0:23:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我凭什么告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.88,0:23:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是路西法绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just Lucifer's desperate,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.23,0:24:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,粘人的跟班\N{\fnArial\fs30}clingy side piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为做路西法的跟班\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause being Lucifer's side piece
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.67,0:24:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是有好处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}has its perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.29,0:24:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now think.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.34,0:24:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.09,0:24:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,WWCD\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wwcd.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.18,0:24:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Castiel do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.28,0:24:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别让人看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to keep out of sight
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我准备好继续上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I can get us back on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.23,0:24:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我渴了  我就是想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thirsty. I just want...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.50,0:25:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(怎么修车)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.35,0:25:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我出了一件事  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened to me, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.26,0:25:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我丧失了希望  我企图...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost hope. I tried to...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.57,0:25:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.43,0:25:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我割了腕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slit my wrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.71,0:25:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I died.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.05,0:25:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.97,0:25:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.48,0:25:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他让我复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought me back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.28,0:25:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是那阵震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was the pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.90,0:25:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在天堂感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We felt that in Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.32,0:25:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}His power...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.20,0:25:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的灵魂涌过了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}his soul surged through me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.87,0:26:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那感觉很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.43,0:26:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很纯  我觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure. I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.94,0:26:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.65,0:26:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.88,0:26:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的孩子做的  那证明了他的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}what your child did, that's a testament to his power,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.69,0:26:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不能证明它的善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not proof of some goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.09,0:26:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他需要你活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.48,0:26:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.90,0:26:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也或许是个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe it was a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.72,0:26:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我经历的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe...maybe everything that I've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.88,0:26:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还需要经历的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything that I still have to go through,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.88,0:26:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是事出有因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is happening for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.56,0:26:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这是一个计划的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's part of some plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.78,0:26:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经相信过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to believe in
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.88,0:26:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.26,0:26:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经相信  我有使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to believe that I had some mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.14,0:26:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我如今已经经历了很多  终于知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have been through enough now to know that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.16,0:26:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都在临场发挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone is just winging it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.54,0:27:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人发挥得不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us quite badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.20,0:27:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.74,0:27:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是在搞破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's just breaking toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.51,0:27:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在播种毁灭和混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sowing destruction and chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.73,0:27:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里面是没有什么大目标的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there is no grand purpose at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.76,0:27:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也没有什么特别角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no special role for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.13,0:27:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法占据鲁尼身体时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Lucifer took over Rooney's body...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.57,0:27:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.55,0:27:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚好在那儿而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.79,0:27:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我的宝宝能为世界做好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know my baby can be good for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.34,0:27:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉  如果他降生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, if he's born...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.90,0:27:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定会因此送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is not something you can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.62,0:27:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So even if you are right,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.02,0:27:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算最坏的可能并非不可避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even if the worst isn't inevitable,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.70,0:27:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你死后  又有谁能来照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}then who will care for him when you're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.60,0:27:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.94,0:27:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会足够强大能保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is strong enough to protect him
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.29,0:27:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还能让他不受邪恶的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to keep him from evil influences and
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.63,0:28:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他一直走正义之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep him on the righteous path?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.91,0:28:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -他刚踢我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - ‭He just -- he just kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.07,0:28:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.67,0:28:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.79,0:28:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这没什么的  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a big deal, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.27,0:28:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他每天要踢我20次呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does it, like, 20 times a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.09,0:28:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.35,0:28:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.56,0:28:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.76,0:29:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}What the hell are you thinking, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.02,0:29:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - ‭What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.76,0:29:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.17,0:29:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.04,0:29:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.00,0:29:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你骗我的柯尔特枪时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, while you were scamming me for the Colt,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.56,0:29:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆在你的手机里安了追踪应用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam put a tracking app on your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.40,0:29:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你回来后  都不肯直视我们的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, when you came back, you didn't even look us in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.34,0:29:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想解释一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna explain what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.76,0:29:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嗯  我找到大衮了  -然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. I found Dagon. - ‭And?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.41,0:29:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你杀掉她了吗  -没有  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you kill her? - ‭No. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.02,0:29:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很不好杀  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's difficult to kill, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.62,0:29:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. ‭You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.76,0:29:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what are you doing here, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.38,0:29:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.08,0:29:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我的车坏了  -那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My truck broke down. - ‭Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.01,0:29:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么不找我们  小卡  我们可以帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why didn't you call us? Cass, we could've helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.17,0:30:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我不希望你们搅进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I wanted to keep you out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.46,0:30:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想保证你们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was trying to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.27,0:30:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是我们的保姆  小卡  那不是你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not our babysitter, Cass, okay? That is not your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.15,0:30:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们这辈子什么时候安全过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when in our whole lives have we ever been safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.64,0:30:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的责任  因为这是我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my responsibility because it is my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.04,0:30:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.36,0:30:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要带我去天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taking me to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.36,0:30:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要带她去沙箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking her to the sandbox?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.32,0:30:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我要彻底终结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm ending this, once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.24,0:30:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉和她的宝宝必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly and her baby have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.55,0:30:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不需要  听着  我们找到别的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they don't. Listen, we found another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.91,0:30:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是肯接电话就会知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you would know that if you would answer your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.08,0:30:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你们说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.23,0:30:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对我  对嘉德利尔做的事  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did with me, with -- with Gadreel, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.70,0:30:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能量抽取\N{\fnArial\fs30}The -- the grace extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿走宝宝  拿非利人的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take the grace from the baby, from the nephilim,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.01,0:30:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝就变成\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the baby just becomes --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.40,0:30:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-人类  -人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Human. - ‭Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.72,0:30:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  那个抽取  险些要了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. That extraction, it nearly killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.33,0:30:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  但我没死  -因为我们没完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but it didn't. - Because we didn't finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.55,0:30:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不知道这能否成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know if this would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.75,0:30:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是有些问题  但至少是个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are kinks, yes, but it's a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.83,0:30:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总比必死无疑强\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it beats the hell out of certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.79,0:30:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.41,0:31:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.56,0:31:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉  凯莉  等等的  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kelly. Kelly. Hey, wait, wait. Wait a second, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.14,0:31:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法想象你经历了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- we can't imagine what you've been through, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.76,0:31:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们说过会想到别的办法  我们想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we promised we'd find another way, and we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.59,0:31:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了别的办法  这能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found a better way. This can work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.16,0:31:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟卡西迪奥去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  凯莉  你跟小卡走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Kelly, if you go with Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.22,0:31:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就死定了  你宝宝也死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you die. Your baby dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.15,0:31:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你走  你会夺走他的特别之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go with you, you take away the thing that makes him special.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.05,0:31:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们都死了  那又有什么要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that matter if you're both dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.19,0:31:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是唯一要紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only thing that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.14,0:31:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这姑娘是疯了  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, this girl has lost her mind. - ‭Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.37,0:31:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我们能不能去别处谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, can we take this conversation elsewhere, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.31,0:31:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在外面就是活靶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're kind of sitting ducks out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.17,0:31:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆是对的  大衮在找凯莉  你的车坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's right. Dagon is after Kelly. Your truck is broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.58,0:31:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们上宝贝车  回地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we get in the Impala, we'll head back to the bunker,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.72,0:31:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-然后谈谈  我们商量清楚  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and we'll talk? We'll figure it out. - ‭Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.00,0:31:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.64,0:31:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-很好  -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. - ‭Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.51,0:31:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-简直像赶猫一样困难  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's like herding cats. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.74,0:31:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办  我们回地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what? We -- we go back to the bunker
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后努力说服他们留下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we just try to convince them to stay there forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.63,0:31:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  锁着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.50,0:32:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不该是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not supposed to happen this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.12,0:32:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.14,0:32:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.22,0:32:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,调头  你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.02,0:32:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.80,0:32:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沙箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The...sandbox,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.51,0:32:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你告诉我怎么去\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you tell me how to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.23,0:32:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉  我可以逼你停车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, I can make you stop this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.42,0:32:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.78,0:32:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.95,0:32:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他选了你  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he chose you, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.61,0:33:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把手放在我肚子上时  我听到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you put your hand on my stomach, I heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.13,0:33:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他对我说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spoke to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.62,0:33:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说  虽然看上去很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me that even if it seems scary,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.05,0:33:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我到达门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I just went to the gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.41,0:33:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我听从你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I just followed your plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.32,0:33:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会确保他的降生\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you would make sure he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.00,0:33:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩  他们想夺走他的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean, they want to take away his powers
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.90,0:33:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为他们害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.35,0:33:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.22,0:33:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-凯莉  -你问我等我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kelly, you -- ‭- You asked me who would protect him,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.61,0:33:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会保护他  引导他  我现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}guide him when I'm gone. I know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.12,0:33:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.99,0:33:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.50,0:33:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.99,0:33:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not someone
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该寄于信心的人  凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you should put your faith in, Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.54,0:33:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前都杀不了大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't kill Dagon back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.88,0:33:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了两个兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost two of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.08,0:33:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我背叛了我的朋友  家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I betrayed my friends, my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.37,0:33:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切发生前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before all this happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.74,0:33:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个二流政治宣传员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a cut-rate political flack
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.67,0:33:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我的老板有着丢人的不专业的感情关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an embarrassingly unprofessional relationship with my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.64,0:34:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为什么偏偏是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.23,0:34:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道为什么偏偏是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know why it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.54,0:34:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道  这是我们注定的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know that we are destined for something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.69,0:34:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伟大的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something great.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.24,0:34:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我有你的信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wish I had your faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.18,0:34:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.89,0:34:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.15,0:34:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪部分  撒谎  天堂计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? The lying? The Heaven plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.25,0:34:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是我修这辆破开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the fact that I'm working on this stupid truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.36,0:34:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  小卡是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, what's wrong with Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.41,0:34:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他这一年过得可不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he hasn't exactly had a banner year.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.37,0:34:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想看  路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, think about it. Between Lucifer...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.22,0:34:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀比莉  雷米尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing Billie, Ramiel,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.94,0:34:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他事事不顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything's been blowing up in his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.18,0:34:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他急着想要一次胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's so desperate for a win right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.58,0:34:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本想不清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he can't even see straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.46,0:34:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead and give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.24,0:35:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-就是这里吗  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is it? - ‭This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.79,0:35:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉  你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.20,0:35:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你在  我知道会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you're here, I know it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.81,0:35:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.28,0:35:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.80,0:35:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你们很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.34,0:35:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  约书亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你肯定很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you must be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.70,0:35:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.28,0:36:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.35,0:36:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你俩就差一点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two got so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.62,0:36:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不是在最后关头及时赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't made it here at the last possible second, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.66,0:36:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.69,0:36:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早就撬开了你哥们凯文的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flipped your pal Kelvin ages ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.01,0:36:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后灭了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}then smoked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.66,0:36:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿等了好几个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.43,0:36:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.18,0:36:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  不拿柯尔特枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, no Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.50,0:36:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.71,0:36:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,枪不在你手上了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even have it anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.80,0:36:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.72,0:36:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他啊  你的守护天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him, your angelic defender.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.05,0:36:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为他能救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really thought he was gonna save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个可悲  慌乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sad, fluttering,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.48,0:36:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无目标的小蛾子\N{\fnArial\fs30}aimless little moth?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.47,0:36:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.59,0:37:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.61,0:37:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该把这个毁掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to take this off the board. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.53,0:37:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.91,0:37:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  谁想吃冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Who wants ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.44,0:37:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小子  得了  这太可悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, come on. It's just getting sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.09,0:37:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.77,0:38:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adorbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.39,0:38:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-小卡  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.03,0:38:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}How...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.44,0:38:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,称之为奇迹吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.16,0:39:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.76,0:39:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.38,0:39:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.60,0:39:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.84,0:39:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was also...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.28,0:39:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.46,0:39:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们来为我们而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for coming to fight for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.12,0:39:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你没事吧  -我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - ‭I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.09,0:39:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直好迷茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been so lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.52,0:39:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在不迷茫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lost anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.27,0:40:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在知道  这个孩子必须降生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know now that this child must be born
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.54,0:40:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并且保留他的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all of his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.28,0:40:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是真心的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't actually mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.30,0:40:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是真心的  我有了信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I do. I have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.74,0:40:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.70,0:40:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  等等  等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass, wait a second. Wait, hold on. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.88,0:40:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们得信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.54,0:40:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  等等  不管那玩意对你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, wait. Okay, whatever that thing did to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.88,0:40:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能就这么让你走掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not just gonna let you walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.55,0:40:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  那不可能的  -可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, that's not gonna happen. - Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.11,0:40:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.16,0:40:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.61,0:41:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟你说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.86,0:41:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.91,0:41:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他给我看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He showed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.15,0:41:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future.

